NL-Veil's Gary modifications rename the tool interface, translate runtime
messages into English, and integrate Cloudflare Containers and authenticated
MCP execution. The corresponding source is in gary-source.tar.gz, together
with its original dependency manifests and installation script. Cloudflare
integration and build sources are provided alongside it in this directory.

